// OmniAgent control plane: a stateless gRPC routing tier in front of the
// gateway (FastAPI) replicas. Every node probes the gateways, ejects failing
// ones, retries idempotent calls on another gateway within the caller's
// deadline, and degrades to stale results when no gateway can answer.
// Node health is the standard grpc.health.v1 service (service name below), so
// clients balance across nodes and route around dead or draining ones.

